From 5a7f3bc48ce4dfabe766aa8d48e42f1c2a7915b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: will <will-tm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:25:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 98/98] hw/net: bcm43341: WPA2-PSK access points and the AP's
 4-way handshake

Lets a guest scan, list and join WPA2-PSK networks, so provisioning an
SSID and passphrase can be tested; a wrong passphrase fails msg2's MIC.
---
 hw/net/bcm43341.c | 542 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 493 insertions(+), 49 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hw/net/bcm43341.c b/hw/net/bcm43341.c
